  rank 1: [doc4_rag.txt#3] score=0.347  &quot;Those chunks are pasted into a prompt as evidence, along with an instruction to answer using only the supplied context, which lets the final answer cite the exact source chunk it came from. Because the corpus lives outside the model, it can be updated at any time without retraining, and answers can be checked against the retrieved text for accuracy.&quot;
