=== Query: What is the time complexity of quicksort in the worst case? ===
  rank 1: [doc1_bfs.txt#1] score=0.168  &quot;It guarantees the shortest path in terms of number of edges when every edge has the same cost. The algorithm marks each node as visited the first time it is reached, so the first path found to any node is provably the shortest one possible.&quot;
